/**
 * @example slice-s7-sampling.cxx
 *
 * @brief [en] Sampling and the power stage: whether there is time to measure the current, and what the bridge does to
 *      the voltage it was asked for.
 * @brief [zh] 采样与功率级：到底有没有时间测电流，以及桥臂对"它被要求的那个电压"做了什么。
 *
 * @section s7_window [en] A single shunt answers a question about duties, not about the ADC [zh] 单电阻回答的是关于
 *      占空比的问题，不是关于 ADC 的问题
 * @par [en] With one shunt in the DC link, the current is visible only while a particular switch pattern is in force:
 *      one phase alone conducting, then two. Both intervals are measured against the settling plus sampling time, and
 *      the answer is three-valued -- measurable, too narrow, or no active vector at all -- because "there is a window"
 *      and "the window is empty" are different things to do next.
 * @par [zh] 母线只有一个采样电阻时，只有某个开关图样成立的那一刻电流才看得见：先是一相单独导通，然后两相。两个
 *      区间都要与"建立时间加采样时间"比较，而答案有三种——可测、窗口太窄、根本没有有效矢量——因为"有窗口"与
 *      "窗口是空的"接下来要做的事不一样。
 *
 * @section s7_angle [en] The window depends on where the vector points [zh] 窗口取决于矢量指向哪里
 * @par [en] Sweeping the modulation index at a fixed angle is not enough: at the sector boundary two phases carry the
 *      same duty, one of the two active intervals is exactly zero, and no modulation index makes it measurable. The
 *      sweep here runs at three angles for that reason, and the flat top of each curve is the modulator clamping, not
 *      the shunt improving.
 * @par [zh] 在固定角度上扫调制比是不够的：在扇区边界两相占空比相同，两个有效区间之一恰好为零，无论调制比多大都
 *      不可测。这里因此在三个角度上扫，而每条曲线顶部的平段是调制器钳位，不是采样变好了。
 *
 * @section s7_frames [en] One correction, three places to read it [zh] 一个修正，三个读数位置
 * @par [en] The dead time costs `deadtime_v` on each phase whose current opposes the commanded edge, and the library
 *      corrects in the phase domain. That correction then has to travel back to alpha-beta to reach the modulator, and
 *      the projection drops the part that is common to all three phases -- a floating star point cannot see it anyway.
 *      Read the same correction in one phase's duty and the modulator's own common-mode shift takes another bite. Three
 *      readings, one number: say which frame you measured in, or the report will not reproduce.
 * @par [zh] 死区在每一相"电流与指令边沿相反"的地方吃掉 `deadtime_v`，而库是在相域里修正的。这个修正要回到 αβ
 *      才能送到调制器，而投影会丢掉三相共有的那部分——浮动的星点本来就看不见它。再去看某一相的占空比，调制器
 *      自己的共模搬移又咬掉一口。三个读数，一个数：报告里必须写明是在哪个参照系量的，否则复现不了。
 *
 * @section s7_shape [en] Two shapes, and the measurement that chose between them [zh] 两种形状，以及替它们做选择的那次
 *      测量
 * @par [en] A fade width turns the correction's step into a ramp that only differs from it between the current where
 *      the sign is trusted and the current where the ramp saturates. It is identifiable, and it still loses: the
 *      header's warning records the comparison and the reason -- the loss on the plant is a soft step, and a linear
 *      ramp cannot represent something that steep. The example is where that warning can be reproduced, not a place to
 *      re-derive it.
 * @par [zh] 给出淡出宽度会把修正的阶跃变成斜坡，而斜坡只在"符号被信任的电流"与"斜坡饱和的电流"之间与阶跃不同。
 *      它是可辨识的，而且仍然输：头文件里的警告记了那次比较和原因——plant 上的损失是一个软阶跃，线性斜坡表示不了
 *      这么陡的东西。这个例子是那条警告可以复现的地方，不是重新推导它的地方。
 *
 * @include slice-s7-sampling.cxx
 *
 * @note [en] Link the aggregate target `foc::foc`; the command on the first line links the two translation units this
 *            demo needs.
 * @note [zh] 链接聚合目标 `foc::foc`；第一行的命令只链了本演示需要的两个翻译单元。
 *
 * @since 0.1.12
 */
